{
  "info": {
    "name": "paccradle API: designs (2026-10-30)",
    "description": "Change: M1-D6, designs endpoints (2026-10-30). The client contract moves to **1.0.0-beta.5** (`api-version`); the admin contract stays at 1.0.0-beta.2. Merge into the main contract.\n\n**New:** `POST /api/client/v1/designs`, `GET /api/client/v1/designs` (paginated: `page`, `page_size`, `total_pages`, with `search`, `style`, `sort`, `order`), `GET` and `PATCH /api/client/v1/designs/{design_id}`. **New codes:** `DESIGN_NOT_FOUND` (404), `DESIGN_INVALID` (400, `meta.detail` in English), `DESIGN_VERSION_CONFLICT` (409, `meta.current_version`). Every list endpoint answers `{items, page, page_size, total, total_pages}` from now on.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
