      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Save a design",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Perfume set\",\n  \"spec\": {\n    \"material\": {\n      \"board\": \"chipboard\",\n      \"thickness_mm\": 1.5,\n      \"clearance_mm\": 1.0,\n      \"slot_tolerance_mm\": 0.3\n    },\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p1\",\n        \"contour_mm\": [\n          [\n            0.0,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            52.0,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            52.0,\n            38.0\n          ],\n          [\n            0.0,\n            38.0\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"height_mm\": 110.0,\n        \"quantity\": 2\n      }\n    ],\n    \"insert\": {\n      \"style\": \"cradle_platform\",\n      \"deck_height_mm\": 40.0,\n      \"margin_mm\": 12.0,\n      \"align\": \"center\",\n      \"placements\": [\n        {\n          \"product_id\": \"p1\",\n          \"center_mm\": [\n            38.0,\n            31.0\n          ],\n          \"rotation_deg\": 0.0\n        },\n        {\n          \"product_id\": \"p1\",\n          \"center_mm\": [\n            102.0,\n            31.0\n          ],\n          \"rotation_deg\": 0.0\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"outer_box\": {\n      \"style\": \"mailer\",\n      \"material\": {\n        \"board\": \"e_flute\",\n        \"thickness_mm\": 1.6,\n        \"clearance_mm\": 1.5,\n        \"slot_tolerance_mm\": 0.5\n      },\n      \"inside_mm\": null\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/client/v1/designs",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "v1",
                "designs"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Saves the editor's design at version 1. Guests may save (their designs move to the account when they sign up or in).\n\n- `name`: shown in \"My designs\"; trimmed, control characters dropped, at most 200 characters; may be left out (empty).\n- `spec`: `insert_core::Design`, the same JSON the WASM preview takes: `material`, `products` (each with `id`, `contour_mm`, `height_mm`, `quantity`), `insert` (`style` and its settings), `outer_box` (or `null`). Copy each product's outline from its capture's `result.products[].contour_mm` (with the typed height): the design keeps the copy, so later taps or edits on the capture don't change it.\n\nRefused with `DESIGN_INVALID` (400) when the spec has the wrong shape or breaks `insert_core`'s rules (the same ones the editor runs in WASM); `meta.detail` says what, in English. A design that doesn't fit its box yet is still saved. Unknown top-level fields are refused. The answer's `spec` is the design as stored: defaults the request left out are filled in."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
